{"id":"n16315-2-7","stage":1,"title":"나흘 · 四号","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16315-2-7-1","ko":"집세는 언제 드리면 될까요?","zh":"房租什么时候交比较合适呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집세는","meaning":"房租","explanation":"집세：房租；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집세","audio":"/audio/d4d231cab576236f3406.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80035","senseId":"1","lemma":"집세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드리면","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d4d231cab576236f","term":"집세","zh":"房租","audio":"/audio/d4d231cab576236f3406.mp3","entryId":"80035","definition":"借住别人家房子而支付给房主的钱。","pronunciation":["집쎄"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7d243484a0e8f5c4125.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16315-2-7-2","ko":"오늘이 사 일이니까 매달 나흘에 주시구려.","zh":"今天是四号，所以每个月四号交就可以了。","note":