5732aa1","term":"매달","zh":"每月，月月","audio":"/audio/acec58ce25732aa11907.mp3","entryId":"15926","definition":"每一月。","pronunciation":["매ː달"]},{"id":"0a91417aa715b1b7","term":"나흘","zh":"四号","audio":"/audio/0a91417aa715b1b7df8b.mp3","entryId":"16315","definition":"每月的第四天。","pronunciation":["나흘"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"允许别人拥有或享有时间等。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b13da6761e89bd718a85.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16315","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天是四号，所以每个月四号交就可以了。","您是哪位？您认识我吗？","房租什么时候交比较合适呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天是四号，所以每个月四号交就可以了。","房租什么时候交比较合适呢？","您是哪位？您认识我吗？"],"answer":0}]}
